  - m_Id: 2168965816388
    m_Localized: '{playerName} makes my heart beep boop.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816389
    m_Localized: Every time I see {playerName}, I declare bankruptcy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816390
    m_Localized: Just want to ride the C.A.R.T. with {playerName}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816391
    m_Localized: '{playerName} is just super mega robocute, you know?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816392
    m_Localized: '{playerName} is my favorite wizard.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816393
    m_Localized: I want to be with {playerName} so much!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816394
    m_Localized: Thinking about {playerName} makes me download the latest update.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816395
    m_Localized: '{playerName}, you make me go gaga ding dong.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816396
    m_Localized: Can't wait to make taxman happy with {playerName} again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816397
    m_Localized: Just want to go to Japan with {playerName}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816398
    m_Localized: I think I have robofeeling for {playerName}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816399
    m_Localized: '{playerName} has the most financially stable smile.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816400
    m_Localized: '{playerName} is like the most upgraded dream.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816401
    m_Localized: Whenever I see {playerName}, I robodance inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816402
    m_Localized: '{playerName} is my favorite silly goose.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816403
    m_Localized: Can't wait to robotickle {playerName} again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816404
    m_Localized: '{playerName}, you brighten my day!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816405
    m_Localized: '{playerName} makes my heart go woop woop.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4469188876779913302
  - m_Id: 2168965816406
    m_Localized: Just want to share secrets with {playerName}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
